          "start": 0
        },
        "quote": "(a) The following are exempt from TMC 18.275.020 :",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.275.030:block:0#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.275.030 block 1",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 1,
          "component_id": "eccb6043-5347-51b3-8bb8-ae5fc3e92a5b",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 210,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.275.030:block:1",
          "start": 51
        },
        "quote": "(1) Any construction, building expansion, or remodeling that, pursuant to Section 105.2 of TMC 14.20.060 , is exempt from the requirement of a building permit.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.275.030:block:1#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.275.030 block 2",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 2,
          "component_id": "07218728-40d2-5140-856b-c3a2afa48055",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 277,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.275.030:block:2",
          "start": 211
        },
        "quote": "(2) The Planning Director may exempt building design standards if:",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.275.030:block:2#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.275.030 block 3",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 3,
          "component_id": "0044d2aa-4e79-5bb9-a4f3-936dd7671720",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 427,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.275.030:block:3",
          "start": 278
        },
        "quote": "(i) The applicant demonstrates that strict application of the design standards results in undue hardship due to one or more of the following factors:",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.275.030:block:3#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.275.030 block 4",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 4,
          "component_id": "864ac0a8-10cb-5459-a27d-60e31a060d61",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 532,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.275.030:block:4",
          "start": 428
        },
        "quote": "(A) The function, size, or use of building renders compliance impractical or economically infeasible; or",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.275.030:block:4#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.275.030 block 5",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 5,
          "component_id": "1684e03b-c6b7-5767-8ac4-eb40a77ed570",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 620,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.275.030:block:5",
          "start": 533
        },
        "quote": "(B) The building, expansion, or remodel is not visible from the public right-of-way; or",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.275.030:block:5#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.275.030 block 6",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 6,
          "component_id": "629f1005-743b-51f6-bd2d-5f745e234bb2",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 806,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.275.030:block:6",
          "start": 621
        },
        "quote": "(C) The design requirement is inconsistent with the overall context of the area, taking into consideration current conditions and comprehensive planning policies for future development.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.275.030:block:6#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.275.030 block 7",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 7,
          "component_id": "3210f38e-be11-586e-97b4-293f86084bfe",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1127,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.275.030:block:7",
          "start": 807
        },
        "quote": "(ii) The strict application of the design standards would result in peculiar and exceptional practical difficulties to, or exceptional and undue hardship upon, the property owner; provided there is no substantial detriment to the public welfare and the purpose and intent of the standards are not substantially impaired.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.275.030:block:7#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.275.030 block 8",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 8,
          "component_id": "2f3e63b7-24a5-542c-87eb-723100a9ac87",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1229,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.275.030:block:8",
          "start": 1128
        },
        "quote": "(b) The Planning Director may approve an alternate building design under the following circumstances:",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.275.030:block:8#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.275.030 block 9",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 9,
          "component_id": "c2103622-2cf9-5ffd-b6ec-1ee826ea1cf7",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1461,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.275.030:block:9",
          "start": 1230
        },
        "quote": "(1) If the design fails to meet one of the requirements for building materials, architectural details, or windows/doors in TMC 18.275.050 , the applicant shall utilize at least one of the elements in subsection (c) of this section.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.275.030:block:9#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.275.030 block 10",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 10,
          "component_id": "473f35b5-91e7-5569-ba50-7db9c31b6916",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1692,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.275.030:block:10",
          "start": 1462
        },
        "quote": "(2) If the design fails to meet two of the requirements for building materials, architectural details, or window/doors in TMC 18.275.050 , the applicant shall utilize at least two of the elements in subsection (c) of this section.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.275.030:block:10#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.275.030 block 11",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 11,
          "component_id": "35bd59fa-fd0a-5468-9588-d2f3053a5e74",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 1901,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.275.030:block:11",
          "start": 1693
        },
        "quote": "(3) If the design fails to meet all three of the requirements in TMC 18.275.050 , the alternate building design elements in subsection (c) of this section cannot be utilized as an alternative building design.",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.275.030:block:11#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.275.030 block 12",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 12,
          "component_id": "3ca991ea-4f7a-5ddf-a123-05f0214c6f4e",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 2026,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.275.030:block:12",
          "start": 1902
        },
        "quote": "(c) Elements that may be utilized in lieu of compliance with the design standards in subsection (b) of this section include:",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.275.030:block:12#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.275.030 block 13",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 13,
          "component_id": "ce83c520-95a8-54f4-9498-90d548cbf501",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 2146,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.275.030:block:13",
          "start": 2027
        },
        "quote": "(1) Excess landscaping (at least 25 percent more points accrued than required) concentrated along public rights-of-way;",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.275.030:block:13#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.275.030 block 14",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 14,
          "component_id": "421a53fb-457b-54c0-9483-93ecd728aa47",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 2310,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.275.030:block:14",
          "start": 2147
        },
        "quote": "(2) Additional parking lot islands (with trees) beyond what is required by the landscaping regulations sufficient to cover at least 25 percent of the parking area;",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.275.030:block:14#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.275.030 block 15",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 15,
          "component_id": "96d61407-d9a6-5b04-acee-c2e53f6818b7",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 2367,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.275.030:block:15",
          "start": 2311
        },
        "quote": "(3) Landscape screening of blank or underdesigned walls;",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.275.030:block:15#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.275.030 block 16",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 16,
          "component_id": "6ed623f2-7cb7-5b2a-b05f-8d0616a5f6d2",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 2623,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.275.030:block:16",
          "start": 2368
        },
        "quote": "(4) Addition of a front or street-facing storefront with an entryway, terrace, outdoor patio, or similar feature with architectural materials and scale that are compatible with the building, and a minimum width of eight feet and minimum height of 10 feet;",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.275.030:block:16#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.275.030 block 17",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 17,
          "component_id": "10673859-b671-5fe2-9d1f-a861cd3234bf",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 2743,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.275.030:block:17",
          "start": 2624
        },
        "quote": "(5) Addition of integrated planters, landscaping features, or wing wall compatible in design and scale to the building;",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.275.030:block:17#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.275.030 block 18",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 18,
          "component_id": "b8fbebb0-1d9b-5be1-a2e0-07294fdf1ee7",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 3019,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.275.030:block:18",
          "start": 2744
        },
        "quote": "(6) Addition of art that is placed prominently on the site, viewable from the public street, integrated with the design of the building/site, and permanent. Art includes, but is not limited to, murals, sculptures, and integrated architectural or landscape architectural work;",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.275.030:block:18#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.275.030 block 19",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 19,
          "component_id": "108edf9a-54c7-57d7-8ff0-90683311972f",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 3174,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.275.030:block:19",
          "start": 3020
        },
        "quote": "(7) Parking located to the side or rear of the building, with at least 50 percent of the lot frontage occupied by building facades with a public entryway;",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.275.030:block:19#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.275.030 block 20",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 20,
          "component_id": "d399123b-f061-5c0d-bbdb-dba18c5c7d18",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 3350,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.275.030:block:20",
          "start": 3175
        },
        "quote": "(8) Bringing existing signs on the property into compliance with current sign code standards, or at a minimum removing or replacing an existing pole sign with a monument sign;",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.275.030:block:20#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.275.030 block 21",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 21,
          "component_id": "dfea37e1-f523-5a99-835a-4033f119f8a0",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 3426,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.275.030:block:21",
          "start": 3351
        },
        "quote": "(9) A minimum of 20 percent higher percentage of required windows/doors; or",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.275.030:block:21#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
      },
      {
        "artifact": "normalized_text",
        "availability": "available",
        "label": "TMC 18.275.030 block 22",
        "locator": {
          "block_index": 22,
          "component_id": "d78dd293-f538-5941-88bb-d4defe9c90cf",
          "convention": "utf8_char_offset",
          "end": 3572,
          "source_component_key": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.275.030:block:22",
          "start": 3427
        },
        "quote": "(10) Additional required architectural details (at least one additional detail per insufficiently met design standard). (Ord. 20165 § 3, 1-8-19.)",
        "ref_id": "ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:18.275.030:block:22#text",
        "unavailable_reason": null
